   "widgets_values": [
    "Bolder edit instruction: dark colours go solid black. Paste it into \"Edit instruction\" and set black_point to 0.40.\n\nRedraw <image1> as a printed black-and-white manga page panel, as if inked by the original artist for serialization. Keep the exact composition, pose, character design, face, expression and drawing style of <image1>. Use confident ink lines with varied line weight. Decide every area as paper white, screentone, or solid black ink: anything that is dark or black in color in <image1> (dark clothing, dark hair, deep shadows) is filled with solid black ink, with its folds and seams left as thin white lines; skin and light surfaces stay white paper; mid colors become flat screentone. No grey gradients, no soft airbrushed shading, no color. Do not add anything that is not in <image1>."
